# NOTE: supabase.properties is intentionally committed so the project runs
# after a plain clone. It holds the Supabase *anon* key (public-by-design,
# access governed by Row Level Security). Override per-environment with the
# SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY env vars or -Dsupabase.* system properties.

